{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01NJwzN7kiRmipUyWE5dewcb","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t{\n2\t  \"raw\": \"完成。核心结果：\\n\\n**Overall temporal DIF (12,508 items):**\\n\\n| Threshold | C% (uncorrected) | C% (BH-corrected) |\\n|-----------|-------------------|--------------------|\\n| 1.0 | 48.93% | 48.16% |\\n| 1.5 | 31.32% | 31.30% |\\n| 2.0 | 18.34% | 18.34% |\\n| 2.5 | 10.22% | 10.22% |\\n\\n**关键发现：**\\n- BH 校正影响极小（56.9% 的 tests 在 BH 下仍显著），因为大 DIF items 的 p-value 本身就很小\\n- \\\">15% large DIF\\\" 结论在 threshold ≤ 2.0 下稳健成立；即使在极严格的 2.5 阈值下仍有 10.2% flagged\\n- Within-family DIF 更高（threshold=1.5 时 50.1% uncorrected / 45.1% BH-corrected）\\n- 审稿人关于阈值校准的质疑可回应：结论不依赖于 1.5 的具体选择\\n\\n产出已注册：报告 `art_20260521_1ac690`，脚本 `art_20260521_00bec4`。\"\n3\t}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_018ahMTN5n8fS1tuSTkuhLhU","session_id":"57957a1b-de9e-4ed3-b03d-6d97dec11257","uuid":"f5f685a4-57f8-4e08-89ac-bda533877be3","timestamp":"2026-05-21T09:01:09.431Z"}
