\nExecutable code generating these results:\n- `/artifacts/plan_018/plan_018_threshold_sensitivity.py`\n- `/artifacts/plan_019/plan_019_instability_decomposition.py`\n- `/artifacts/plan_020/plan_020_circularity_ablation.py`\n- `/artifacts/plan_021/plan_021_nonuniform_dif.py`\n- `/artifacts/plan_022/plan_022_model_independence.py`\n- `/artifacts/plan_023/plan_023_item_characterization.py`\n- `/artifacts/plan_026/plan_026_constat_dif_comparison.py`\n\n### **7. KEY METRICS SUMMARY**\n\n| Experiment | Primary Metric | Result | Status |\n|------------|---|---|---|\n| plan_018 | Threshold Robustness | 31.3% C (threshold=1.5) stable with/without BH correction | PASS |\n| plan_019 | Domain Contribution | Domain explains 2.4pp/7.6%; item-level dominates | PASS |\n| plan_020 | Non-tautology | DIF removal z=-9.5 (vs -156 for accuracy gap); uncorrelated strategies | PASS |\n| plan_021 | Non-uniform DIF | 38.7% items with non-uniform DIF; discrimination shifts matter | PASS |\n| plan_022 | Model Independence | C% driven by N, not redundancy; 31.3% robust | PASS |\n| plan_023 | Characterization | Difficulty×direction ρ=-0.597; clear diagnostic pattern | PASS |\n| plan_026 | ConStat Orthogonality | Enrichment=0.964 with contamination; Jaccard=0.206 | PASS |\n\n### **8. ARTIFACT REGISTRATION**\n\nAll experiments registered in the dream_registry and checkpoint system with timestamps between May 20-21, 2026. Complete audit trail available in `/logs/workers/` with corresponding result JSONs and chat logs.\n\n**Total data volume:** ~114K lines CSV + 1.2K lines markdown analysis + 7 complete Python implementations"}],"totalDurationMs":44247,"totalTokens":79914,"totalToolUseCount":24,"usage":{"input_tokens":7,"cache_creation_input_tokens":830,"cache_read_input_tokens":76828,"output_tokens":2249,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":830},"inference_geo":"","it